Package: golang-github-x11libre-go-x11proto-dev
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 golang-golang-x-image-dev,
Description: pure-Go X11 protocol library and widget toolkit (sources)
 A pure-Go X11 protocol library (client side), built around goroutines for
 parallel processing. It offers both xcb-style low-level access and an
 Xlib-style high-level API, supports little- and big-endian servers, and
 ships a small widget toolkit (tk): windows, drawing, fonts, keyboard,
 clipboard, theming, images and the RENDER extension.
 .
 This package ships the Go source so other Go programs can build against it.

Package: xnamespace
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Static-Built-Using: ${misc:Static-Built-Using}
Description: client tool for the X-NAMESPACE extension
 A small command-line client for the X-NAMESPACE X11 extension: it lists,
 creates, queries and deletes server-side namespaces and manages their auth
 tokens. The extension is privileged; against a server that does not offer it
 the commands fail with "extension not available".
 .
 Supports an optional -json flag for machine-readable output.

Package: tetris64
Section: games
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Static-Built-Using: ${misc:Static-Built-Using}
Description: Tetris game built on the go-x11 widget toolkit
 A Tetris demo for the pure-Go go-x11 X11 toolkit, with multiple resolutions
 (FHD/WQHD/UHD4K), colour and mono themes, embedded artwork and an in-game
 help window. Doubles as a showcase of the toolkit's drawing, image and
 input handling.
